        <figcaption>August 3, 2026</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p>
        If you got to see my shenanigans, I hope you found it entertaining. Now go outside, touch grass, and drag your dreams
        from fantasy into reality like I am; truly recommended.
      </p>
      <p>
        The algorithm is truly toxic, so much so that I don’t even have a fake/alt account. If you want to share memes with me,
